Hello Christoph,
I am not an expert on this, but i may give you my point of view from what I can read.
There are several reasons of why this may be happening, one of this is that the data that you have is not good enough for the complex model that you are building.
One way to figure this out is to start building a basic model and check the result if they are what you expect, then make it a bit more complex every-time.

I hope it works!

--
Diego Rondon

